title: We must deport Zephyrian spies.
subtitle: They threathen our republic and inflate support for radical parties.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if judicial_reform < 2 : Unfortunately, the judiciary will not cooperate. ?]
view-if: zephyr_deported = 0 and investigate_far_right >= 2
choose-if: judicial_reform >= 2 and kcp_in_goverment == 1

Is it realy this simple? Wont this inflame anger from the radical parties?

- @force_success: Deport them!
- @no_deport: No, we must not.

@force_success
on-arrival: zephyr_deported = 1; workers_hp -= 10; new_middle_hp -= 10; old_middle_hp -= 10; rural_hp -= 10; unemployed_hp -= 10;  workers_vnpf -= 10; new_middle_vnpf -= 10; old_middle_vnpf -= 10; rural_vnpf -= 10; unemployed_hp -= vnpf; kcp_tyrrany += 1;

Many citizens deemed to be Zephyrian spies are deported with their citizenship revoked. This greatly harms the anti-KCP parties which often got their votes but also increases our perceived tyrrany.

@no_deport
go-to: root

We will not be deporting Zephyrians.
